<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n7824" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνάχῠσις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>,
			ἡ<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">,
			ἀναχέω&lt;&gt;</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>expansion, effusion,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χολῆς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aret.
					<u>SD</u>
					1.15
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰκτεριώδης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Sor.
					1.48
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ruf.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				79.9
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πύου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Erasistr.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				8.318
			</span></i>; 
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν εἰδῶν εἰς τὸ ὄν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Simp.
					<u>in Ph.</u>
					503.32
				</span></i>
			: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. ψυχῆς</span>”
				<i>exhilaration,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					2.187
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			<i>exhalation,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ ὠκεανοῦ</span> (causing fogs) <i><span class="en">
				Prisc.
				p.341
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ τῆς ἀσωτίας ἀ.</span>
			<i>excess</i> of profligacy, <i><span class="en">
				<u>1 Ep.Pet.</u>
				4.4
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ ἀλόγου πάθους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					1.695
				</span></i>
			; of enthusiasm, <i><span class="en">
				Metrod.
				<u>Herc.</u>
				831.13
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>expanse</i> of water, e.g. <i>estuary,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Str.
				3.1.9
			</span></i>: pl., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. θαλάττης</span>”
				<i>inundations,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Max.Tyr.
					38.3
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνάχυσιν λαμβανούσης τῆς θαλάσσης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ocell.
					3.4
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> an
			expectorant, 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σύμφυτον</span>
			, Ps.-<i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				4.9
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
